Prompt:

[Character]: {adult woman, appearance and hairstyle}
[Outfit]: {dress / styling}
[Setting]: {room, greenhouse, bedroom, café, etc.}
[Activity]: {reading, writing, drinking tea, listening to music, etc.}
[Expression]: {quiet gaze / laughing / looking aside / absorbed in the activity}
[Lighting]: {soft rainy daylight / morning light / overcast light}
[Aspect ratio]: 9:16

Create a photorealistic, intimate lifestyle portrait with strong emotion and natural human presence.

Keep the character, outfit, environment, lighting, and overall color palette visually consistent throughout the series. Only vary her expression, gaze, posture, hand gestures, and small interactions with the scene.

The subject must feel like a real adult person caught in an ongoing moment, not a model holding a pose. Use imperfect, relaxed body language: shifting her weight, turning halfway, pausing mid-page, laughing unexpectedly, pressing her lips together, looking away, lowering her eyes to the book, or reacting naturally to someone behind the camera.

Let the eyes carry the emotion. Avoid repeating direct eye contact in every image. Mix eye contact, sideways glances, downward focus, subtle smiles, spontaneous laughter, and thoughtful expressions.

Hands should always be doing something meaningful and natural: holding an open book, turning a page, resting loosely on the bedding, touching the face, or reacting mid-gesture. Avoid symmetrical or staged hand placement.

Use soft natural light, realistic skin texture, subtle pores, natural tonal variation, clear individual hair strands, loose flyaways, and soft fabric folds. Avoid plastic skin, excessive retouching, oily highlights, stiff poses, mannequin-like expressions, and CGI texture.

Use an 85–105mm portrait photography feel, shallow but realistic depth of field, soft foreground blur, and a slightly observational camera angle. Preserve enough environmental detail to make the scene feel lived-in and believable.

The final image should feel intimate, intelligent, feminine, lightly sensual, emotional, and alive, as if the photographer captured a genuine moment rather than directing a photoshoot.

